209
00:14:39.700 --> 00:14:44.009
[S04] Just because you have the job title of an artist doesn't mean that you are one.

210
00:14:44.169 --> 00:14:48.009
[S04] These people don't understand that a word is the new brush stroke,

211
00:14:48.029 --> 00:14:50.960
[S04] the new low-pass filter and the new select and mask.

212
00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:54.029
[S04] They don't understand that every minor decision an artist makes

213
00:14:54.049 --> 00:14:57.070
[S04] that imbues their personal touch into their work is still available

