00:15:00.549 --> 00:15:05.110
[S04] without spending hours doing so, but they just can't see beyond random text box generation.

216
00:15:05.139 --> 00:15:09.759
[S04] The single distinction that will separate art from slop is taste.

217
00:15:09.789 --> 00:15:12.529
[S04] So, in other words, nothing has changed.

218
