00:19:26.900 --> 00:19:31.700
[S04] because that's when you turn your life around the most, when you're under pressure.

288
00:19:31.740 --> 00:19:35.029
[S04] And personally, I don't see why you wouldn't pick the second option.

289
00:19:35.059 --> 00:19:38.630
[S04] Because changing your life doesn't mean you have to pack everything up,

