00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:51.509
[S04] It requires you to pursue something you care about.

294
00:19:51.539 --> 00:19:56.599
[S04] It requires you to take risks, create a story worth telling and share it with those who can benefit.

295
00:20:19.990 --> 00:20:24.549
[S05] Versus the scientists and the future demands that we merge these polar ends.

