[S05] Because a builder has always needed a thinker.

297
00:20:27.130 --> 00:20:31.900
[S05] A programmer not paired with a marketer almost always leads to a disappointing number of users.

298
00:20:31.970 --> 00:20:36.700
[S05] A hippie stuck in the sky and a scientist stuck in an atom are both missing the truth.

299
00:20:36.799 --> 00:20:41.859
[S05] Those who can embody this duality become unstoppable and we're already seeing it happen.

300
00:20:41.930 --> 00:20:48.000
[S05] It's like an example of how job titles are shifting from designer and engineer to design engineer.

301
00:20:48.029 --> 00:20:52.970
