354
00:24:40.170 --> 00:24:43.329
[S05] I love writing, books, newsletters, social posts, etc.

355
00:24:43.500 --> 00:24:48.299
[S05] And the thing here is that I do have AI prompts that complement my process.

356
00:24:48.329 --> 00:24:50.500
[S05] Because I I have a process, right?

357
00:24:50.529 --> 00:24:51.869
[S05] That I can teach AI.

358
00:24:52.029 --> 00:24:54.470
[S05] And I'm not talking about a process for writing.

359
00:24:54.599 --> 00:25:00.569
[S05] I'm talking about a process that refines ideas to the point of being able to put out something great.

360
00:25:00.599 --> 00:25:03.700
[S05] So as an example, I'll put the link to this in the description.

361
00:25:03.730 --> 00:25:08.700
[S05] But one of my favorite prompts is just like a very good thought partner, right?

362
00:25:08.730 --> 00:25:10.269
[S05] I programmed it.

363
00:25:10.430 --> 00:25:14.829
[S05] I wrote the prompt in a way that doesn't give me the answer.

364
00:25:14.930 --> 00:25:20.769
[S05] It asked me questions relevant to a topic that guides me toward insights faster than usual.

365
00:25:20.970 --> 00:25:25.670
[S05] Because I was able to take the process of how I generate my best ideas.

366
00:25:25.869 --> 00:25:31.700
[S05] And put it into a prompt that kind of guides me through that so I can reach those ideas faster.

367
00:25:31.730 --> 00:25:38.930
[S05] So rather than me having to go on a ton of walks, which I still do, or listen to a ton of books and content, which I still do.

368
00:25:38.970 --> 00:25:45.430
[S05] It creates this guide for my mind that helps me reach these certain points faster.

369
00:25:45.470 --> 00:25:49.529
[S05] Because the way you generate ideas is by thinking, right?

370
00:25:49.569 --> 00:25:54.029
[S05] Debating, conversing, asking questions to yourself.

371
00:25:54.130 --> 00:25:58.130
[S05] So if I can program the AI to ask questions like I would myself.

372
00:25:58.150 --> 00:26:04.869
[S05] Because when you're questioning yourself, you're usually running through a series of what, why, how, what, what, whatever.

373
00:26:04.930 --> 00:26:08.269
[S05] They're kind of predictable and you can put that into a prompt.

374
00:26:08.299 --> 00:26:13.569
[S05] And if anything, it's actually drastically increased the quality of my writing and creativity.

375
00:26:13.670 --> 00:26:17.099
[S05] So all of my newsletters and social content is written by hand.

376
00:26:17.130 --> 00:26:19.930
[S05] And I change and refine a lot of the ideas that the

