00:26:24.230 --> 00:26:27.369
[S06] It's an experiment. It's a first draft. Most people don't realize that.

379
00:26:27.400 --> 00:26:32.069
[S06] Like, obviously, yeah, if you just paste what AI says into whatever medium you're posting it on,

380
