[S06] then yeah, it's gonna suck. You're not that, you're not practicing developing your taste.

381
00:26:37.180 --> 00:26:41.910
[S06] You have to be tasteful and pick and choose from what the AI outputs.

382
00:26:41.940 --> 00:26:45.369
[S06] Now, outside of your craft, outside of what you enjoy doing,

383
00:26:45.400 --> 00:26:50.130
[S06] I see prompts, prompt engineering, as creating specialized employees,

