00:27:01.339 --> 00:27:03.809
[S06] where you ask questions and treat it like it's your friend.

388
00:27:03.839 --> 00:27:09.170
[S06] I personally hate marketing. I mean, I don't hate it, but I, I don't like spending time on it, right?

